# Copy to .env.local to switch on the direct GPT link (decisions D15, D17).
# Leave unset to keep the manual route: copy the prompt, work in ChatGPT, paste the reply and upload.
# The key stays on your computer: the app only uses it server-side.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Optional:
# OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-2.6-sunburst   (draws the image boards; the default)
# OPENAI_IMAGE_QUALITY=medium           (low | medium | high; high costs about 4x medium)
# OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL=gpt-5-mini          (writes the descriptions)
